WARNING: These legacy tests require a local Skyrim SE installation:
- ESLoader_Tests needs Skyrim Data\ + loadorder.txt next to the binary (see Code/components/es_loader/ESLoaderTest.cpp).
- TiltedReverse_Tests needs DLL.dll (TiltedReverse) and injects into a fake WinMain (see Libraries/TiltedReverse/Code/tests/src/reverse.cpp).
They are documented as environment-dependent and are not part of the RFAB port verification gate.

